          },
          "notes": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Optional, beside pr: a caveat the person should read before approving the merge, such as something you could not set on the PR. It goes on the merge card; the verifier never sees it. A reason you could not open the PR is blocked, not a note."
